WEBVTT

00:00:00.115 --> 00:00:10.099
This video shows how to set the monthly fee of a class on your phone. Fee Setup is where you decide what each class pays before any fee records are made.

00:00:11.777 --> 00:00:23.297
Tap the menu button at the top left, open Finance, and choose Fee Setup. The Monthly Structure tab lists each class as a card, with its charges and the total per month.

00:00:23.914 --> 00:00:32.194
Keep By Class selected, then tap Edit on the class you want to change. The card opens so you can change its charges.

00:00:33.207 --> 00:00:42.711
Change the amount of the fee category, here Tuition Fee to 3500. You can also add or remove charges on this card.

00:00:43.754 --> 00:00:51.698
Tap Review and Save. The card now shows each charge and the new total per month, before anything is saved.

00:00:59.777 --> 00:01:08.225
Tap Confirm and Save. A message says the charges were saved, and fee records you generate later will use this amount.

00:01:11.588 --> 00:01:18.740
The class fee is updated. Next, you can generate fee records and start collecting payments.
